                rel="noreferrer"
                target="_blank"
              >
                License
              </a>
              . Artistic orientation and exposure; not epoch-calibrated. Procedural planets remain illustrative.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
        <footer>
          PERMAGENT / WORLD
           
          <span>
            The Solar Forum
          </span>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>
</div>
`;

