            </p>
            <button
              class="pa-btn pa-btn--bare"
              style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: transparent; --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: transparent; --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 2px 5px;"
            >
              <span
                class="pa-btn__label"
              >
                Try a question for this role 
                <span
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  ↗
                </span>
              </span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <details
            class="agent-desk-disclosure"
          >
            <summary>
              Role & working style
            </summary>
            <p>
              Your sovereign orchestrator — the leader you name. Discuss an outcome, clarify the scope, and decide which specialist should help.
            </p>
            <p>
              Calm, attentive and decisive. Finds the real outcome behind a request, then brings the right collaborators together.
            </p>
            <blockquote>
              Warm and direct. Clarify the outcome; explain tradeoffs without grandstanding.
            </blockquote>
            <p>
              This agent has a daemon event source. Its presence alone does not confirm a connection or a running job.
            </p>
            <button
              class="pa-btn pa-btn--bare"
              style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: transparent; --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: transparent; --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 2px 5px;"
            >
              <span
                class="pa-btn__label"
              >
                How agents work ↗
              </span>
            </button>
          </details>
          <details
            class="agent-desk-disclosure"
          >
            <summary>
              Identity & passport 
