            </p>
            <blockquote>
              Warm and direct. Clarify the outcome; explain tradeoffs without grandstanding.
            </blockquote>
            <p>
              This agent has a daemon event source. Its presence alone does not confirm a connection or a running job.
            </p>
            <button
              class="pa-btn pa-btn--bare"
              style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: transparent; --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: transparent; --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 2px 5px;"
