          </div>
          <details
            class="agent-desk-disclosure"
          >
            <summary>
              Role & working style
            </summary>
            <p>
              Your sovereign orchestrator — the leader you name. Discuss an outcome, clarify the scope, and decide which specialist should help.
            </p>
            <p>
              Calm, attentive and decisive. Finds the real outcome behind a request, then brings the right collaborators together.
            </p>
            <blockquote>
              Warm and direct. Clarify the outcome; explain tradeoffs without grandstanding.
            </blockquote>
            <p>
              This agent has a daemon event source. Its presence alone does not confirm a connection or a running job.
            </p>
            <button
              class="pa-btn pa-btn--bare"
              style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #059669; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #1E2530; --pa-btn-border: transparent; --pa-btn-bg-hover: #F8FAFC; --pa-btn-border-hover: transparent; --pa-btn-bg-active: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-pad: 2px 5px;"
            >
              <span
                class="pa-btn__label"
              >
                How agents work ↗
              </span>
            </button>
          </details>
          <details
            class="agent-desk-disclosure"
          >
            <summary>
              Identity & passport 
              <span>
                Optional
              </span>
            </summary>
          </details>
        </section>
        <div
          class="agent-desk-support"
        >
          <details
            class="agent-desk-disclosure"
          >
            <summary>
              Work in flight 
              <span>
                0 active
              </span>
            </summary>
            <section
              class="forum-work"
            >
              <div
                class="eyebrow"
              >
                WORK IN FLIGHT
              </div>
              <p>
                No active jobs reported.
              </p>
            </section>
          </details>
          <details
            class="agent-desk-disclosure"
          >
            <summary>
              Tools & skills
            </summary>
          </details>
          <details
            class="habitat-world-settings"
          >
            <summary>
              World details & attribution
            </summary>
            <p
              class="note"
            >
              Milky Way backdrop: ESA/Gaia/DPAC; CC BY-SA 3.0 IGO; acknowledgement A. Moitinho. 
              <a
                href="https://www.esa.int/ESA_Multimedia/Images/2020/12/The_colour_of_the_sky_from_Gaia_s_Early_Data_Release_32"
                rel="noreferrer"
                target="_blank"
              >
                Source
              </a>
               · 
              <a
                href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/igo/"
                rel="noreferrer"
                target="_blank"
              >
                License
              </a>
              . Artistic orientation and exposure; not epoch-calibrated. Procedural planets remain illustrative.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
        <footer>
          PERMAGENT / WORLD
           
          <span>
            The Solar Forum
          </span>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>
</div>
`;

