            >
              Milky Way backdrop: ESA/Gaia/DPAC; CC BY-SA 3.0 IGO; acknowledgement A. Moitinho. 
              <a
                href="https://www.esa.int/ESA_Multimedia/Images/2020/12/The_colour_of_the_sky_from_Gaia_s_Early_Data_Release_32"
                rel="noreferrer"
                target="_blank"
              >
                Source
              </a>
               · 
              <a
                href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/igo/"
                rel="noreferrer"
                target="_blank"
              >
                License
              </a>
              . Artistic orientation and exposure; not epoch-calibrated. Procedural planets remain illustrative.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
        <footer>
          PERMAGENT / WORLD
           
          <span>
            The Solar Forum
          </span>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>
</div>
`;

